        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The staff below shows F major with its solfège names, and the notes under the lowest Do as well. Tap {{3}}, {{2}} and {{1}}, and stop: the tune rests on Do.\nNow tap {{1}}, {{7}} and {{6}} downward from that Do, and stop: the tune rests on the ringed La."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
