            "text": "Press Play under the staff below to start the band: four bars that come home to Do, then four that come home to La, round and round. Hum the home note of each half, then tap {{1}} or {{6}} on the staff to check.\nKeep going until you can say \"Do\" or \"La\" as each half begins."
